---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="News"
  description="News and updates from the CAL-Pathfinder collaboration."
>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- <span class="eyebrow">Updates</span> -->
      <h1>News</h1>
      <p class="desc">
        The latest news and updates from the Salemi Group.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>



  <hr class="divider">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label"></span>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">






        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/campanile.jpg" alt="Sather Tower" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">June 1, 2026</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                At the end of the academic year, we wish a fond farewell to some of our members.<br>
                • Anish: post-bacc --> graduate school at UIUC.<br> 
                • Aarav: post-bacc --> graduate school at Yale.<br>
                <br>
                We also congratulate graduating members who are staying in the group!<br>
                • Brennan: undergrad --> post-bacc in our group.<br>
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>





        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/melgar_quassolo.jpg" alt="Evan adn Penelope picture" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">May 4, 2026</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                <a href="https://physics.berkeley.edu/news/2026-pi2-summer-scholar-cohort-selected" style="color: #002676">Congratulations to Evan on being selected in the Pi2 Scholar Program!</a> Evan is working with grad student Penelope on superconducting magnet design.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>



        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/emily_shining_lights.png" alt="Emily Perry picture" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">May 1, 2026</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Congratulations to Emily on completion of the Shining Lights program! (Photo: A.J. Gubser)
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>


        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/tabitha_suli.jpg" alt="Tabitha Esposito picture" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">April 2, 2026</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Congratulations to Tabitha on presenting her research at the SULI Poster Session!
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>




        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/shreya_website_0.jpg" alt="Shreya Puranam picture" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">April 2, 2026</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                Congratulations to Shreya for recieving the Outstanding Graduate Student Instructor Award!
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>




        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/holden_website.png" alt="Holden Kowitt picture" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">April 30, 2025</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                <a href="https://h2h8.com/research-grants/undergraduate-research/" style="color: #002676">Congratulations to Holden for recieving the H2H8 Undergraduate Research Grant!</a>
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>




        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="../public/images/bread.png" alt="BREAD collaboration logo" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">April 30, 2025</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                <a href="https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.134.171002" style="color: #002676">First axion-like particle results from BREAD</a>.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
       



        <div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--blue); padding: 1rem;">
          <!-- Two-column container -->
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: flex-start;">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Image -->
            <div style="flex-shrink: 0; width: 200px;">
              <img src="https://news.berkeley.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/4NewFac_Phys_4Bob-1536x877.jpg" alt="Faculty hires" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Right Column: Text Content -->
            <div style="flex-grow: 1;">
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">
                <div>
                  <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;font-size:16px">August 4, 2024</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p style="margin-bottom: 0;font-size:18px"">
                <a href="https://news.berkeley.edu/2024/08/01/four-new-faculty-hires-are-a-quantum-leap-for-experimental-physics/" style="color: #002676">Four new faculty hires are a quantum leap for experimental physics</a>.
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>




      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</Layout>
